    <div class="container">
        <h1>ETSA Event Timeline</h1>

        <div class="timeline">

            <div class="event">
                <h3>March 2026 — ETSA Launch</h3>
                <p>The official launch of Esport Talent Search Africa, establishing the first continental esports talent pathway.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="event">
                <h3>April 2026 — Federation Outreach</h3>
                <p>Engagement with African National Sporting Authorities to integrate ETSA into national development programs.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="event">
                <h3>May 2026 — Digital Skills & Esport Workshops</h3>
                <p>Introductory workshops across selected African regions to identify early talent and build awareness.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="coming-soon">
            <h2>Upcoming Events</h2>
            <p><strong>June 2026 — ETSA Online Qualifiers</strong><br>First open esports talent identification qualifiers across Africa.</p>

            <p><strong>July 2026 — ETSA Regional Finals</strong><br>Top performers from each region compete for continental ranking.</p>

            <p><strong>August 2026 — ETSA Continental Showcase</strong><br>Live event highlighting Africa’s top emerging esports talent.</p>

            <p>More events will be added as ETSA expands across the continent.</p>
        </div>

    </div>

